T:Breathe on Me, Breath of God
T:AYLESBURY
C:Music: found in John Chetham's Psalmody, 1718 · Words: Edwin Hatch, 1878
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: Hymns Ancient and Modern, 1904 Hymn 449. (not in 1875 ed.; can't get hands on 1889 supplement) 1904 edition is UNSIGNED. The hymnary.org score found for comparison (hymnary.org/tune/aylesbury_camp) is a different tune or version, so the melody follows the Open Hymnal's source.
