w: Breathe on me, breath of God, Fill me with life a- new,
w: Breathe on me, breath of God, Un- til my heart is pure,
w: Breathe on me, breath of God, So shall I ne- ver die,
z A G F | c A B A | G F c B | A2 G2 | F4 |]
w: That I may love what Thou dost love, And do what Thou wouldst do.
w: Un- til with Thee I will one will, To do and to en- dure.
w: But live with Thee the per- fect life Of Thine e- ter- ni- ty.
